{%- comment -%}
  HooknLoop — Order cancelled
  ===========================
  Paste into: Settings > Notifications > Order cancelled > Edit code.

  TONE
  Same system as the other notifications, with one deliberate departure: the
  button is not orange. Orange marks the one action worth taking, and there is
  no happy action on a cancellation — pushing a bright button at someone whose
  order just disappeared reads as tone deaf. The button is a quiet outline, and
  the emphasis goes where the anxiety actually is: the money.

  So the refund line is the largest thing under the headline, and it says when
  the money lands, not just that it will. "5–10 business days" is the honest
  range for a card refund clearing in Australia; adjust if your processor is
  faster, but do not promise faster than it is.

  If the order was cancelled by us rather than the customer, the reason is
  shown. An unexplained cancellation generates a support ticket every time.
{%- endcomment -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light only">
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only">
  <title>Order {{ order_name }} cancelled</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body,table,td,a { -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; -ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }
    table,td { mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; border:0; height:auto; line-height:100%; outline:none; text-decoration:none; }
    body { margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important; width:100% !important; background:#f4f7fb; }
    a { color:#b8460a; }
    @media only screen and (max-width:600px){
      .full { width:100% !important; }
      .px { padding-left:22px !important; padding-right:22px !important; }
      .stack { display:block !important; width:100% !important; }
      .stack-gap { height:22px !important; line-height:22px !important; font-size:22px !important; }
      .btn a { display:block !important; text-align:center !important; }
      .h1 { font-size:27px !important; line-height:1.18 !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f7fb;">

  <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; color:#f4f7fb;">
    Order {{ order_name }} has been cancelled and your refund is on its way.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f7fb;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:0 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="full"
               style="width:600px; max-width:600px; margin:26px 0; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- ══ MASTHEAD ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#ffffff; padding:26px 30px 22px;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="left" valign="middle">
                    {%- if shop.email_logo_url %}
                      <img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 180 }}" style="display:block; max-width:200px; border:0;">
                    {%- else %}
                      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4509/3489/files/logo_5.png?v=1767767497" alt="HooknLoop" width="180" height="32" style="display:block; width:180px; height:32px; border:0;">
                    {%- endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" valign="middle">
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#5a6b8c; text-transform:uppercase;">Order</div>
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.02em; color:#142548; padding-top:3px;">{{ order_name }}</div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e7ecf4; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

          <!-- ══ MESSAGE ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 30px 0;" class="px">
              <h1 class="h1" style="margin:0; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:31px; line-height:1.14; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#142548;">
                Order {{ order_name }} has been cancelled.
              </h1>
              {%- comment -%}
                No body paragraph here, deliberately.

                It used to print "Reason: {{ cancel_reason }}", but that
                variable holds Shopify's internal enum — customer, declined,
                inventory, fraud — so it rendered as "Reason: customer.", which
                tells the reader nothing and reads like a leaked database field.

                The rest of the sentence promised the money was coming back,
                which the refund panel directly below already states with the
                actual amount and timeframe. Saying it twice in three lines made
                the email feel like it was arguing with itself.

                Headline states the fact, panel states the money, the line above
                the button covers "this was a mistake". Nothing left to add.
              {%- endcomment -%}
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ REFUND ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          {%- comment -%}
            The money is the anxiety, so it gets the emphasis a CTA would
            normally take: amount large, in mono, with a plain-English timeframe
            underneath rather than a vague "shortly".
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 30px 0;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f7fb; border-radius:12px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:20px 22px;">
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#b8460a; text-transform:uppercase;">Refund</div>
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:24px; font-weight:700; color:#142548; padding-top:8px;">{{ total_price | money_with_currency }}</div>
                    <div style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#5a6b8c; padding-top:8px;">
                      Back to your original payment method. Card refunds usually clear in 5&ndash;10 business days, depending on your bank.
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ CANCELLED ITEMS ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 30px 0;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:2px solid #142548;">
                {%- for line in subtotal_line_items %}
                  <tr>
                    <td valign="top" width="62" style="padding:15px 14px 15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4;">
                      {%- if line.image %}
                        <img src="{{ line | img_url: 'compact_cropped' }}" width="62" height="62" alt="" style="display:block; width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:8px; background:#f4f7fb;">
                      {%- else %}
                        <div style="width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:8px; background:#f4f7fb;">&nbsp;</div>
                      {%- endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:15px 12px 15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4;">
                      <div style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.4; color:#142548;">{{ line.title | default: line.product.title }}</div>
                      {%- if line.variant.title and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
                        <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:#5a6b8c; padding-top:5px;">{{ line.variant.title }}</div>
                      {%- endif %}
                      <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#142548; padding-top:7px;">&times;&nbsp;{{ line.quantity }}</div>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="padding:15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4; white-space:nowrap;">
                      <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; color:#142548;">{{ line.final_line_price | money }}</span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                {%- endfor %}
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ QUIET CTA ═════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:26px 30px 34px;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="btn">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="border:1.5px solid #142548; border-radius:10px;">
                    <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 26px; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; color:#142548; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px;">
                      Browse the range
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ FOOTER ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#142548; padding:32px 30px;" class="px">
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4509/3489/files/hnl-email-logo-footer.png?v=1786003221" alt="HooknLoop" width="164" height="29" style="display:block; width:164px; height:29px; border:0;">
              <div style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.62; color:#8194b5; padding-top:14px; max-width:430px;">
                Australian hook &amp; loop specialists — tapes, strips, dots and fasteners, stocked and dispatched locally.
              </div>
              <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13); margin-top:22px; padding-top:22px;">
                <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#f0842a; text-transform:uppercase; padding-bottom:12px;">Need a hand?</div>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="stack" valign="middle" style="white-space:nowrap; padding-right:18px;">
                      <a href="tel:+61340616287" style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap;">+61&nbsp;3&nbsp;4061&nbsp;6287</a>
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack-gap" style="font-size:0; line-height:0; height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                    <td class="stack" valign="middle" align="right" style="white-space:nowrap;">
                      <a href="mailto:info@hooknloop.com.au?subject=Order%20{{ order_name | url_encode }}" style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#c9d3e6; text-decoration:none; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,211,230,0.38); white-space:nowrap;">info@hooknloop.com.au</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>
              <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13); margin-top:22px; padding-top:16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="left"><a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">hooknloop.com.au</a></td>
                    <td align="right" style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:0.05em; color:#8194b5; white-space:nowrap;">Order {{ order_name }}</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
